WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:05.140
Once upon a time, three little pigs
decided to build their own houses.

2
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:10.680
The first pig built the house with grass, the
second with wood and the third with bricks.

3
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:17.260
One day, a big gray wolf came, and he blew
the first house and the second house.

4
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:24.500
Two little pigs ran into the red house and the Big Wolves
wanted to blow to the red house, but the red house was strong.

5
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.880
Three pigs are safe, they understand
that working hard brings security.

